# Build context for the Dockerfile. `fly deploy` and `docker build` read this file, not .gitignore.
# Unlike .gitignore it deliberately lets the git-ignored runtime files through, so they reach the image
# without being committed: the trained model (data/processed/*.joblib), the GCBD survey table
# (data/raw/gcbd.csv) and the UNEP-WCMC reef-area tiles (data/processed/reef_area_tiles/).
.git
.github
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
.venv*
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
**/*:Zone.Identifier
frontend/
reefsense/dist
reefsense/.vite

# Raw downloads stay out (GCBD SQLite, UNEP-WCMC shapefile zip): large, and the WCMC source data must not
# be made downloadable. The model's neighbour lookup only reads the survey table.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/gcbd.csv
